The preceding code defines the properties and the constructor of the ArtistService class.
The implementation injects the IArtistRepository,
IItemRepository, IArtistMapper, and IItemMapper dependencies. The
Repositories classes will be used for communicating with the underlying data source of
the application. On the other side, the mappers will be called to initialize and map the
values sent as responses.
Once we have defined the dependencies of the ArtistService class, we can proceed with
the implementation of the core methods:

public class ArtistService : IArtistService
{
